Vertex AI / Agent Platform

“Vertex AI / Agent Platform is a complete AI environment within Google Cloud. It provides various services and tools needed to build, deploy, and use AI models and AI applications.”

Simply:

Vertex AI / Agent Platform = A large platform in Google Cloud for doing AI-related work.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


It includes:

🤖 AI Models — Models such as Gemini
🧠 Agents — Build AI agents
🎨 Studio — Build and test AI/Agents
💻 Notebooks / Cloud Shell — Write and run code
🔍 RAG / Search — Connect AI with your data
🚀 Deployment — Deploy AI applications

================

In one line:

Cloud Shell = Place to write and run code
Agent Studio = Place to build AI Agents
Vertex AI / Agent Platform = The larger Google Cloud platform that provides these and many other AI services.

